5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by examining the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks to understand where our previous efforts have succeeded or failed.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Toshio's focus on outcomes. I would like to look into the booking data for specialist and general rooms, as well as the timetable records on rooms out of service.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I'll focus on the human element. I'd like to review the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"To ensure we have a realistic timeline and budget, I will examine the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To complement your findings, I shall look into the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier to see if our financial projections align with reality.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have all selected our areas of inquiry, I believe we have a comprehensive spread of data. I am satisfied with these choices.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. We have covered the operational, financial, and human aspects of the campus. I believe this balanced approach will lead us to a rational decision.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,Indeed. There is no need to overlap our efforts when we can trust each other to report the findings accurately.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I concur. Let us proceed to the investigation phase so we can bring these facts back to the table.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Quite right. I look forward to seeing how these disparate threads of data weave together into a coherent picture of our current needs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
